{"id":"wb-5-368","name":"芋头侗寨古建筑群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芋头侗寨古建筑群","text":"芋头侗寨古建筑群位于中国湖南省通道侗族自治县双江镇芋头村，2001年被列为第五批全国重点文物保护单位。\n芋头侗寨始建于明洪武年间，清顺治年间大火后重建，形成七个聚居点。主要的古建筑有四座鼓楼、三座风雨桥、一座门楼、两口古井、两座萨岁台、七十八座吊脚楼以及古驿道等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%8B%E5%A4%B4%E4%BE%97%E5%AF%A8%E5%8F%A4%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":92293271,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92293271","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3a3ca4908a5f1f2b8889eaff.jpg","title":"芦笙鼓楼5.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%8A%A6%E7%AC%99%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC5.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8b/%E8%8A%A6%E7%AC%99%E9%BC%93%E6%A5%BC5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"三猎","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​芋头侗寨芦笙鼓楼。","width":320,"height":213}}